{"title":"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_4\">Problem 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the general antiderivative of the function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/4/414584cbc33c3e71bce4d338b052ef2b6862f435.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4-x^{2}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"130\" height=\"43\" />?\n</p><p>\t<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/1/c416bb6063ac5863f7eb48c2d935696328853add.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\sin^{-1} \\left( \\dfrac{x}{2} \\right) + C \\quad \t\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\dfrac{1}{2}\\sin^{-1}\\left( \\dfrac{x}{2} \\right) + C \\quad \t\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\ln \\left( \\sqrt{4-x^{2}} \\right) + C \\quad \t\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{4x- \\dfrac{x^{3}}{3}}} + C \\quad \t\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\sqrt{4-x^{2}} +C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -42px\" width=\"855\" height=\"67\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\tTo evaluate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/6/28642dc5a462afa5bc968f5deba281cb583dbbe3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}} dx$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"111\" height=\"43\" />, we factor our a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in the square root and perform a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/d/9ad99798ec4c38e165cf517cb9e02b1c9e824103.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-substitution with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/0/8104aa868b8750dc7ff0530a545b19ab7ff4789c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u = \\frac{x}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"51\" height=\"34\" />, obtaining <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/d/1cdead0d81c646adb93da5919f2c1c2afba4821a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$du = \\frac{1}{2} dx$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"79\" height=\"38\" /> and\n\t<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/1/031f960e75e26dec95749d07b700278d5dc7ab38.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\, dx = \\frac{1}{2} \\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - \\left( \\frac{x}{2} \\right)^{2}}}\\, dx = \\frac{1}{2} \\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^2}} \\cdot 2\\, du = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\sin^{-1} \\left( \\dfrac{x}{2} \\right) + C}.\\]\" width=\"642\" height=\"57\" />\n</p><p>~Blosp\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest\">2026 TMTA Calculus</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width